"UNKNOWN|NOT SURE|CANNOT|REMEMBER|FORGOT|MEDICATION|MEDS|PILL|ALLERGY|BLOOD PRESSURE|CHOLESTEROL|BLOOD THINNER|ANTIBIOTIC|ANTIFUNGAL|REFLUX|SHOT|OXYGEN|DIALYSIS|EYE|EAR|DROP|DROPS|GTT|GTTS|SALINE|MIST")
